# Becomes .gitignore in YOUR profile's own backup repo (tasks/setup-profile.md, step 8).
# Your profile is never part of the Resume-Generator repo; to keep history and sync it
# between computers, make it its own PRIVATE repository (ask your agent to set it up).

# data/ is a cache of job descriptions; scan.py rebuilds it.
data/
# previews/ is regenerated by engine/preview_templates.py --mine
previews/

# private/ holds salary, address and other form answers. Choose:
#  - keep this line: private/ stays only on this computer (copy it by hand to others)
#  - delete this line: private/ is backed up and synced too; fine for a private repo
#    nobody else can access, but remember it before adding collaborators or apps
private/

*.log
*.aux
.DS_Store
~$*
.~lock.*#
